<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Foster Wheeler said cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Foster Wheeler said cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers downgraded Foster Wheeler Corp to outperform from buy, a market source said.</p>
<p>-- The stock closed at 34-1/8 Tuesday.</p>
